{"id":"n42236-1-8","stage":5,"title":"대견하다 · 了不起","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42236-1-8-1","ko":"할아버지께 자리를 양보하다니 우리 아들 정말 대견하구나.","zh":"能把座位让给爷爷，我们儿子真是太棒了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지께","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지께","audio":"/audio/4ced95a17475d2e68459.mp3"}},{"text":"자리를","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리를","audio":"/audio/516d8c7572e851763074.mp3"}},{"text":"양보하다니","meaning":"让步，让出","explanation":"양보하다：让步，让出；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"양보하다","audio":"/audio/115fbf2a7420012cb850.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66570","senseId":"1","lemma":"양보하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양보하다니","audio":"/audio/0c876f890ea4e7ab3776.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"아들","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"대견하구나.","meaning":"了不起，不简单，令人欣慰","explanation":"대견하다：了不起，不简单，令人欣慰；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"대견하다","audio":"/audio/535bef720bc1319c5b1a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42236","senseId":"1","lemma":"대견하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대견하구나","audio":"/audio/34dd9af1074212422177.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"115fbf2a7420012c","term":"양보하다","zh":"让步，让出","audio":"/audio/115fbf2a7420012cb850.mp3","entryId":"66570","definition":"为他人让出位置或给出东西。","pronunciation":["양ː보하다"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"535bef720bc1319c","term":"대견하다","zh":"了不起，不简单，令人欣慰","audio":"/audio/535bef720bc1319c5b1a.mp3","entryId":"42236","definition":"满意且引以自豪的。","pronunciation":["대견하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e0473fb7cc4d2a36cac9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42236-1-8-2","ko":"뭘요. 대단한 일도 아니에요.","zh":"哪里的话，这没什么了不起的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘요.","meaning":"表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。","explanation":"뭐：表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。；요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"4","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘요","audio":"/audio/c5411ac41a421bff90be.mp3"}},{"text":"대단한","meaning":"很出色，很杰出","explanation":"대단하다：很出色，很杰出；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대단하다","audio":"/audio/a89a72f50dfdf2daf4dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46607","senseId":"3","lemma":"대단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대단한","audio":"/audio/ef0d9ec5963b3d16f4cf.mp3"}},{"text":"일도","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일도","audio":"/audio/a24f7f49d733e1e2c1d8.mp3"}},{"text":"아니에요.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"a89a72f50dfdf2da","term":"대단하다","zh":"很出色，很杰出","audio":"/audio/a89a72f50dfdf2daf4dc.mp3","entryId":"46607","definition":"非常突出。","pronunciation":["대ː단하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/10805a0a601105477ccc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42236","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2267,"questions":[{"lineInde